      en: ["Jbissa is one of the largest gas fields in northeastern Syria.", "The gas treatment plant was modernized during the 1980s.", "It is situated about 50 kilometers south of Hasakah city.", "The field supplies gas to power stations in the center of the country.", "Jbissa produces billions of cubic meters of natural gas annually.", "The area is also known for its significant sulfur deposits."],
      es: ["Descubrimiento: 2003.", "Inicio de producción: 2007.", "Profundidad de extracción: 3.000-3.500 m.", "Reservas estimadas: 3 billones de pies cúbicos.", "Producción diaria antes de la guerra: 500 millones de pies cúbicos.", "Operador: Syrian Gas Company."],
      pt: ["Descoberta: 2003.", "Início da produção: 2007.", "Profundidade de extração: 3.000-3.500 m.", "Reservas estimadas: 3 biliões de pés cúbicos.", "Produção diária antes da guerra: 500 milhões de pés cúbicos.", "Operador: Syrian Gas Company."],
      fr: ["Découverte : 2003.", "Début de la production : 2007.", "Profondeur d'extraction : 3 000-3 500 m.", "Réserves estimées : 3 000 milliards de pieds cubes.", "Production quotidienne avant la guerre : 500 millions de pieds cubes.", "Exploitant : Syrian Gas Company."],
