      en: ["Suwaydiya was discovered in 1959 as Syria's first major oil field.", "It is the largest oil field in the country by surface area.", "The oil produced is heavy crude with high viscosity.", "It hosts its own gas power plant for local electricity supply.", "Reserves are estimated to be over 1 billion barrels.", "The field is located near the Syria-Iraq-Turkey tripoint."],
